[engl]
{100}{}{Ian}
{200}{}{You see a short, stocky man.}
{210}{}{You see Ian.}
{220}{}{He has the confident, relaxed stance of an experienced fighter.}
{1000}{}{[AUTO-GENERATED SKELETON: replace this entry with the NPC's initial greeting and
conditions.]}
{1010}{}{[MANUAL: initial branch condition/greeting -> Ian02]}
{1020}{}{[MANUAL: initial branch condition/greeting -> Ian12]}
{2000}{}{I may not be a very good fighter any more, but I'm good enough to best the likes of you!}
{2010}{}{[Done.]}
{3000}{}{Hello, stranger. You look like you're new here. What's your name?}
{3010}{}{My name's not important.}
{3020}{}{My name's @pname@.}
{3030}{}{Urgh?}
{4000}{}{Well, then, neither are you.}
{4010}{}{[Done.]}
{5000}{}{Sorry, but I don't have time to waste on morons.}
{5010}{}{[Done.]}
{6000}{}{What can I do for you?}
{6010}{}{Can you give me directions to the Hub and Junktown?}
{6020}{}{Hmm. Nothing. Never mind, Ian.}
{6030}{}{You can leave now.}
{6040}{}{Draw your best weapon next time we go into battle.}
{6050}{}{How about a piece of the action, instead?}
{6060}{}{What weapons are you skilled with?}
{7000}{}{The Hub is a big trading center far south of Shady Sands. It's run by several different caravan groups of merchants: the Water Merchants, the Crimson Caravan, and the Far Go
Traders. Junktown is a little south and a ways west. It's smaller, but still a good place to drop in for a drink. It's overseen by a fellow by the name of Killian Darkwater, the local shopkeeper, sheriff, and mayor.}
{7010}{}{Thanks.}
{8000}{}{So,
---
, what can I do for you?}
{8010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Ian12a]}
{9000}{}{So, what can I do for you?}
{9010}{}{Tell me about Shady Sands.}
{9020}{}{Can you give me directions to the Hub and Junktown?}
{9030}{}{Could you help me out a bit? Your experience would be useful.}
{9040}{}{Could you help me out a bit? Your experience would be useful.}
{9050}{}{Tell me about Radscorpions.}
{9060}{}{Tell me about Seth.}
{9070}{}{Tell me about the raiders.}
{9080}{}{Nothing, thanks.}
{10000}{}{Shady Sands is a small but self-sufficient community. The only trouble here is with the bandits and the Radscorpions.}
{10010}{}{Are there many bandits?}
{10020}{}{Why are the Radscorpions trouble?}
{10030}{}{Thanks.}
{11000}{}{There are several. They come from various groups. They steal our food and occasionally
shoot a few people. Seth organized the guards to help fight them off.}
{11010}{}{Can you tell me about Seth?}
{11020}{}{There are different groups? Who are they all?}
{11030}{}{Thanks.}
{12000}{}{Seth is a very brave fighter. He occasionally goes to the Radscorpion caves to kill a
few Radscorpions, but they always wind up coming back. There are just too many for him
to fight.}
{12010}{}{Are the Radscorpions really that dangerous?}
{13000}{}{Radscorpions are very dangerous. They have a poisonous stinger in the tail, and they are
very quick. Aradesh has been trying to find a way to get rid of them. If you feel brave,
you could talk to Aradesh about them.}
{13010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{14000}{}{There are three groups: the Khans, the Vipers, and the Jackals. They pretty much hate
each other, but they all raid Shady Sands.}
{14010}{}{Tell me more about Shady Sands.}
{14020}{}{Thanks.}
{15000}{}{Hmm. Tempting offer, since this place gets boring. Tell ya what. Standard rates. 100 caps, and you've got a deal.}
{15010}{}{Deal.}
{15020}{}{How about a piece of the action, instead?}
{15030}{}{No thanks.}
{16000}{}{Let's go. It'll be good to get back into action!}
{16010}{}{[Done.]}
{17000}{}{[MANUAL: add NPC dialogue for diagram node 'hire_Ian']}
{17010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> join_party]}
{18000}{}{All right, I'll help you out in exchange for my share of loot.}
{18010}{}{Urgh?}
{19000}{}{Well, since you ask, all right. See you around.}
{19010}{}{[Done.]}
{20000}{}{Sure thing.}
{20010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Ian15]}
{21000}{}{All right, I'll help you out in exchange for my share of loot.}
{21010}{}{No, I don't think so. Come back when you have some caps.}
{21020}{}{This is the Weapon Shop. It's run by Beth. She's good for guns, but better for gossip.}
{21030}{}{Jake's weapons. High prices, but really good guns.}
{22000}{}{Sure thing.}
{22010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Ian15]}
{23000}{}{Sure thing.}
{23010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Ian15]}
{24000}{}{Sure thing.}
{24010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Ian15]}
{25000}{}{I'm a good shot with just about any sort of pistol, and I can use a submachine gun, too.
I also know how to handle a knife.}
{25010}{}{[MANUAL: add player response/transition -> Ian15]}
{26000}{}{Can I do something for you before I go?}
{26010}{}{Um, yeah. I think we should stick together, after all.}
{26020}{}{Uh, no. Thanks.}
{27000}{}{No, I don't think so. Come back when you have some caps.}
{28000}{}{No thanks. I'm needed here.}

